      ":question/problem": "Find the value of $|\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & =7|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}|-3|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7(6-1)-1(0+3)-3(0+9) \\\\  & =7\\cdot 5-1\\cdot 3-3\\cdot 9 \\\\  & =35-3-27 \\\\  & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    }
  }
